{"obsah":"<p>We have our first two Bikeskills camps behind us, held over the weekend in Tehov and the surrounding area. Attendance was affected by lots of cancellations due to illness, which hit those around us too. We mostly covered the basics and fine-tuned body position, and the women rode the pump track a lot. The men's group focused more on drops and benches. The weather was kind to us and there were very few crashes. Hopefully our coaching will give riders more confidence for the coming season. Riders who cancelled were moved to further camps and individual coaching.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F04%2F20250413_114359.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F04%2F20250413_114359.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250565\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F04%2F20250413_120116.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F04%2F20250413_120116.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250567\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F04%2F20250413_154451.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F04%2F20250413_154451.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250566\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googl